// Suspicious SQL Query | T1190, T1505.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/category/database/db_anomalous_query.yml
*drop* OR *truncate* OR *dump* OR *select\ \**

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*drop* OR *truncate* OR *dump* OR *select\\ \\**",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
